    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textSpeed
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: As you all now our city has fallen to those mutant creatures, causing
        us to retreat to this bunker and leave our homes behind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: But today, we start on taking back our city from those creatures and
        show them that we are not to be messed with any longer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: You, Bob, along with other scouts will start making maps of the city,
        including where enemies are and where it's safe, so I'd recommend finding
        a high vantage point to map out the city.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: We all have faith in our scouts, as everyone's futures lies in your
        hands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: You have seven days before we strike back. Goodluck and safe travels.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 469634859250221618, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: DialogueCanvas (1)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
